  "original_caller": "Finite real Euclidean carrier, V∈C², both global Hessian bounds αI≤∇²V≤βI, 0<α≤β, η>0, βη≤1. No extra derivative/H1/small-step/Nontrivial/c>=1 premise.",
  "objects_domains": "Real L2 AE classes on actual Gaussian-augmented π_eta; HP=Y-measurable macro subspace; HP0=macro mean-zero; Hperp=kerP. SAME actual P/U/A, unique positive ΓP, its centered restriction ΓP0, genuine inverse Inv on HP0 only, polar V and actual fP/fperp/fV.",
  "B20_definition": "C(u,v)=1/2(‖u‖²−‖v‖²)−〈A0 Inv u,v〉 for u,v∈SAME HP0. B20 is definition, not bound.",
  "B23_sharp_pair_and_actual_f": "|C(u,v)|≤(‖u‖²+‖v‖²)/(2γ); actual fP/fV norm budget gives |C(fP,fV)|≤‖f‖²/(2γ). Sum Hilbert energy, never ordinary product max norm.",
  "B19_definition": "Lω(f)=‖f‖²+ωC(fP,fV) for actual globally centered f.",
  "B22_B24_consumer": "All real 0<ω≤γ, including ω=γ: 1/2‖f‖²≤Lω(f)≤3/2‖f‖² and |Lω(f)−‖f‖²|≤ω/(2γ)‖f‖²≤1/2‖f‖². Same components and witnesses independent of ω.",
  "gamma_exact": "γ=2sqrt(αη)/(1+αη)>0; rank zero and αη=1 legal.",
